	(text "INT must be driveable: GT911 reads it at reset to set its\nI2C address. RESET shares IO48 with the onboard WS2812;\nasserts once at boot. 4.7k pull-ups; go smaller if 400kHz\nis flaky (GT911 Programming Guide, communication section)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 235.204 52.578 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.635 0.635)
			)
		)
		(uuid "23cbda77-4e0e-4b5e-9aa8-93987b8b772f")
	)
	(text "Unused LSBs (R0-R2, G0-G1, B0-B2) tied low. RGB565 drives the\ntop 5/6/5 bits; floating inputs would flicker."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 138.43 90.932 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.635 0.635)
			)
		)
		(uuid "5168b817-0b36-4123-9809-3a8aa0482376")
	)
	(text "DISP tied high: display always on, saves a GPIO. Deliberate.\nPanel SPI (CS/SCL/SDA) tied off, no pins left on board 2.\nIf the panel stays blank at bring-up, it may need SPI init.\nHSYNC/VSYNC negative polarity per datasheet p.9."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 137.414 95.758 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.635 0.635)
			)
		)
		(uuid "62e30da5-7446-45ac-881b-ba08e7214f3f")
	)
	(text "Backlight: 8 LEDs x 3 strings, ~25.6V at 60mA. Adafruit\n1932 driver tops out at 24V/7 LEDs, so XL6009 instead.\nSet module to ~30V by trimpot: 25.6V + 60mA x 75R."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 236.22 105.156 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.635 0.635)
			)
		)
		(uuid "793381c5-eac4-4dac-953c-1f4e1bf25242")
	)
	(text "LINK2 is TX only. Board 3 sends nothing back.\nThis is what fits board 2 into 27 pins."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 240.284 135.382 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.635 0.635)
			)
		)
		(uuid "c0694a9b-d35f-40e8-8efb-e8728f8eadff")
	)
